{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f17302e149fed1e38f90b58a032375190a256d10c3b29f06d530401a01210ee2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":431},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["服从政府的权柄"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["人人都要服从执掌权柄的，因为所有的权柄都是出于上帝。所有掌权的都是上帝设立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["所以，抗拒掌权者，就是抗拒上帝的命令，抗拒的人必自招惩罚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["掌权的不是叫行善的惧怕，而是叫作恶的惧怕。你想不怕掌权的吗？就要行善，这样你会得到他的称赞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为掌权的是上帝的仆人，对你有益处。然而，你若作恶，就该惧怕，因为他必将你绳之以法",{"noteId":56},"。他是上帝的仆人，代表上帝秉公行义，惩奸罚恶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["所以，你们必须服从，不单是为了免受惩罚，也是为了良心无愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你们纳税也是为了同样的缘故，因为掌权的是上帝的仆人，负责管理这类事务。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡是人该得的，都要给他。该得粮的，就纳粮给他；该得税的，就缴税给他；该惧怕的，就惧怕他；该尊敬的，就尊敬他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["爱邻如己"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["凡事都不可亏欠人，但在彼此相爱方面要常常觉得亏欠。一个人爱别人，就成全了律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["因为“不可通奸、不可杀人、不可偷盗、不可贪心”",{"noteId":57},"以及其他诫命，都可以总结成一句话——“爱邻如己”",{"noteId":58},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["爱不会作恶害人，所以爱成全了律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["还有，要知道现今是你们该睡醒的时候了！因为与初信的时候相比，我们得救的日子更近了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["黑夜已深，白昼将临，我们要除掉黑暗的行为，穿上光明的盔甲",{"noteId":59},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我们要为人端正，光明磊落，不可荒宴醉酒，不可好色邪荡，不可嫉妒纷争。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你们要活出主耶稣基督的荣美",{"noteId":60},"，不可放纵本性的私欲。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":56,"caller":"+","text":"“他必将你绳之以法”希腊文是“他佩剑，不只是作作样子”。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":4}},{"noteId":57,"caller":"+","text":"出埃及记20:13‑15、17；申命记5:17‑19、21。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":58,"caller":"+","text":"利未记19:18。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":59,"caller":"+","text":"“穿上光明的盔甲”或译“带上光明的兵器”。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":12}},{"noteId":60,"caller":"+","text":"“活出主耶稣基督的荣美”希腊文是“穿上主耶稣基督”。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}